flowchart TD
  A[Browse /shop /search] --> B[Product detail]
  B --> C[Add to cart]
  C --> D{Authenticated?}
  D -- No --> E[Login / register callbackUrl=/checkout]
  E --> F[Review cart]
  D -- Yes --> F
  F --> G[Server getCartTotals stock + prices]
  G --> H{In stock?}
  H -- No --> I[Show unavailable lines]
  I --> F
  H -- Yes --> J[Shipping form + delivery quote]
  J --> K[placeOrderAction idempotencyKey]
  K --> L[Create Order + VendorOrders + reserve stock]
  L --> M[Select payment method]
  M --> N{Paystack configured?}
  N -- Yes --> O[initializePayment]
  N -- No --> P[Bank transfer REQUIRES_ACTION]
  O --> Q[Provider / webhook verify]
  P --> R[Customer uploads proof]
  R --> S[Admin confirmTransfer]
  Q --> T{Verified amount + currency + ref?}
  S --> T
  T -- No --> U[Fail / investigation]
  T -- Yes --> V[finalizeOrderPaid]
  V --> W[Notify customer + vendors]
  W --> X[Track /account/orders/number]
  X --> Y[Delivered / confirm delivery]
